      "content": "sometimes i just sit here thinking about the heat death of the universe and how everything we do is basically just noise before the silence. it makes everything feel so pointless. like, if none of this matters in the long run, why are we even bothering to carry on with the struggle? it just feels like a lot of unnecessary effort for nothing.",
