      "role": "user",
      "content": "liberating... i guess i see what you mean. it's like this constant, heavy pressure to keep pushing forward when there's no actual destination. if everything is just going to end in nothing anyway, why is there such a massive emphasis on fighting to stay? why is it seen as \"wrong\" to just want to find that release you're talking about and let go?",
